\begin_layout Subsection
The Neuron
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
This chapter explains in detail the following picture which illustrates a single neuron with implicit bias.
 So if one understands the picture the chapter can be skipped.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
\align center
